Z||000000||MinnGreenGT||09-25-2001||10:19 AM||||Well, it's been a long week- and it's only Tuesday.  Ugh.  Well I'm experiencing a brain-fart and need some assistance.  I'm trying to get all the necessary bulbs for my <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/010073.html" TARGET=_blank>"Clear GT Taillight"</A> project- but I can't remember what all the bulbs are!<P>I seem to remember that the Brake/Taillights are 1157's... right?  As are the turn signal lights...?  How about backup lights... are they 1157's also?  And finally the backlighting for the "PONTIAC" on the back... someone mentioned that they are smaller- like dash lights.  Anyone have a reference for the correct bulb numbers?  Help!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/halfpole.gif">  <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||5
