Z||000002||sqoach||09-25-2001||12:01 PM||||I know that the front turn signals and tail lights are the same. The backup lights are different. 1157 sounds right for the tail lights. I believe the backup's were 2057. Not sure on the 'pontiac' lights. Don't have a fastback.<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">          <BR>^^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^^<BR><LI><FONT SIZE="1">84 SE (FOR SALE)*SOLD(?)*<BR><LI>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR><LI>86 SC</FONT>||||reg||1
